# Python 3.14 stack for NVIDIA GPUs, installed as a second runtime beside the AMD one by
# scripts/add_inference_path.sh. cuda-py314.lock is compiled from this file.
# The PyPI torch wheel is the CUDA 13.0 build. Its version has no local tag, and only that
# build covers sm_120, so the lock's hashes are what keep a +cu126 wheel out.
# Never add cupy or cucim: TotalSegmentator would switch to a different resampler.
-c constraints.txt
torch==2.14.0
torchvision==0.29.0
